  <widget type="label" version="2.0.0">
    <name>Scope</name>
    <x>20</x>
    <y>765</y>
    <width>930</width>
    <height>55</height>
    <text>Serval writes .tpx4 files or sends binary events to an external TCP consumer. The IOC does not decode raw events. File prefix/pattern and splitting are ignored for TCP. Preview and Image are configured in Destinations.</text>
    <wrap_words>true</wrap_words>
  </widget>
